<title>BELGIUM: Body found rolled up in carpet on Belgian street.</title>
<headline>Body found rolled up in carpet on Belgian street.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A passer-by who saw a rolled-up carpet on a Brussels pavement and decided to take it home found a body inside, police said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The body found in the suburb of Schaarbeek in the Belgian capital was of a young North African man, police said.</p>
<p>A police official said he had been hit on the head with a blunt object but had no other details.</p>
</text>
